NOTE ON THE FICTION

Axis Financial Services, AxisPay, and every merchant, customer, payment,
settlement record, acquirer and API key in this repository are FICTIONAL and
exist only to make the training realistic. Any resemblance to a real
institution is coincidental.

No real cardholder data appears anywhere. `scripts/validate/verify-course.sh`
asserts that no payment card number pattern exists in the seed data, and that
assertion runs on every verification.
